IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. BHSH.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-I PIC 9(05).
01 WS-ACC PIC 9(15) VALUE 0.
01 WS-B PIC 9(03) VALUE 0.
01 WS-TMP PIC 9(18) VALUE 0.

LINKAGE SECTION.
01 LS-HSH-IN PIC X(400).
01 LS-HSH-LEN PIC 9(04).
01 LS-HSH-OUT PIC X(16).

PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LS-HSH-IN LS-HSH-LEN LS-HSH-OUT.
    MOVE 0 TO WS-ACC
    IF LS-HSH-LEN > 400
        MOVE 400 TO LS-HSH-LEN
    END-IF
    PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > LS-HSH-LEN
        COMPUTE WS-B = FUNCTION ORD(LS-HSH-IN(WS-I:1)) - 1
        COMPUTE WS-TMP = WS-ACC * 997 + WS-B + WS-I
        COMPUTE WS-ACC = FUNCTION MOD(WS-TMP, 1000000000000000)
    END-PERFORM
    MOVE WS-ACC TO LS-HSH-OUT
    GOBACK.
